  "w": "16-crowd.js:981"
 },
 {
  "k": "<i>Species: Nāgá.</i> “Cherished companions of Flavius, these serpents become formidable contenders, embodying the essence of Asclepius, ensuring a ceaseless crimson cascade upon the arena sands.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Virgilante, ludus notes</span>",
  "w": "16-crowd.js:1010"
 },
 {
  "k": "<i>Species: Canis lupus.</i> “Valencia and Moechus, masters of the hunt, possess an insatiable appetite within the arena, their natural prowess and docility allowing them to effortlessly track their prey.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Cassius Dio, ludus notes</span>",
  "w": "16-crowd.js:1011"
 },
 {
  "k": "<i>Species: Atlas.</i> “Ursa may hold the upper paw, but do not underestimate the thunderous might of Brutum. Beware, for crossing their paths means daring to challenge their dominion, even at the cost of their cherished treasure.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Pomponius Mela, ludus notes</span>",
  "w": "16-crowd.js:1012"
 },
 {
  "k": "<i>Species: Barbary Lion.</i> “Transported clandestinely across the treacherous Mediterranean during the frigid grip of last winter’s mare clausum, these untamed exotic beasts ignite a frenzy of excitement within the crowd as they unleash their primal fury, tearing limbs asunder and delivering savage face-maulings.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Pomponius Mela, ludus notes</span>",
  "w": "16-crowd.js:1013"
 },
 {
  "k": "<i>Species: unknown.</i> “With its otherworldly visage and unparalleled brutality, Tholo stands as a living testament to the extraordinary and the unfathomable, seizing the gaze of spectators from across the empire, instilling fear that resonates within their souls.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Virgilante, ludus notes</span>",
  "w": "16-crowd.js:1014"
 },
 {
  "k": "<i>Species: Human.</i> “Master of deception and self-proclaimed Champion Victorious, Commodus, a consummate fabricator, forges a path devoid of allies, shamelessly usurping the title within the realms of Flavius Rule.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Cassius Dio, ludus notes</span>",
  "w": "16-crowd.js:1015"
 },
 {
  "k": "The golden eagle of the games: too fast to hit, too proud to land, happiest carrying off something a gladiator was about to enjoy.",
  "w": "16-crowd.js:1016"
 },
